# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=python-yaml
_name=pyyaml
_lockname=pyyaml
pkgver=6.0.2
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="YAML for Python (Mesa reads some of its tables with it)"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://pyyaml.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(python)
source=("https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/source/P/PyYAML/pyyaml-$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('d584d9ec91ad65861cc08d42e834324ef890a082e591037abe114850ff7bbc3e')

package() {
    # the pure-Python form (the C speed-up needs Cython and libyaml)
    PYYAML_FORCE_CYTHON=0 pip3 install --no-index --no-build-isolation --no-deps --ignore-installed \
        --root="$pkgdir" --prefix=/usr "$srcdir/$_name-$pkgver"
}
